'''Summon Greater Harbinger of Focus''' is a [[skill]] granted by {{il|The Immortal Will}}.

==Skill Functions and Interactions==
Summons a harbinger that is immortal and will occasionally apply "The Immortal Will" on the player character while the player character is channeling. "The Immortal Will" is a buff that lasts 4 seconds, with a cooldown of 8 seconds, and grants the following benefits:

*Immunity to elemental [[ailments]]
*[[Stun]] immunity
* 20% less damage taken
*Unaffected by [[Curses]]

The duration of the buff can be lengthened through the use of effect-lengthening buffs such as [[Shaper's Presence]] from [[Solstice Vigil]].

[[Temporal Chains]] is another effect-lengthening effect but as '''The Immortal Will''' makes you immune to [[curses]], you cannot be affected with [[Temporal Chains]] while you have the buff.

All "Summon Harbinger" skills share a maximum of 1 Summoned Harbinger.

==Drop Restrictions==
The '''Summon Greater Harbinger of Focus''' skill can only be acquired by equipping [[The Immortal Will]].


